{"Title":"Community Development and Small Businesses -- Extension Order","BillNumber":"S2750","DocketNumber":"SD3203","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PMP0","Name":"Pavel Payano","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMP0","ResponseDate":"2024-04-25T16:30:01.573"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PMP0","Name":"Pavel Payano","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMP0","ResponseDate":"2024-04-25T16:30:01.5733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2750/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Extension Order","Pinslip":"Filed by Mr. Payano -- Order relative to granting the committee on Community Development and Small Businesses until May 22, 2024, within which time to make its final report on current House document numbered 4065, relative to improving and modernizing planning and community development in the city of Boston.","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That,  notwithstanding the provisions of Joint Rule 10, the committee on Community Development and Small Businesses be granted until May 22, 2024, within which time to make its final report on current House document numbered 4065, relative to improving and modernizing planning and community development in the city of Boston.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Ought to be Adopted","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2750","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2750/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"}]}